## Test Cases

### Test Case 1

Board State:

```text
X | X | _
O | O | _
_ | _ | _
```

Expected Move:

```text
2
```

Reason:

Player X wins immediately by completing the first row.

---

### Test Case 2

Board State:

```text
O | O | _
X | _ | _
_ | _ | X
```

Expected Move:

```text
2
```

Reason:

Player X blocks O from winning.

---

### Test Case 3

Board State:

```text
_ | _ | _
_ | _ | _
_ | _ | _
```

Expected Move:

```text
4
```

Reason:

The center position provides the best strategic advantage.

